<div class="block">
	<div class="block-container">
		
			
		
		<div class="block-row wiki-content" id="content">
			<div id="mw-content-text" lang="en-GB" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr"><div class="mw-parser-output"><div style="text-align:right;"><a href="/wiki/index.php/Main_Page" title="Main Page">Back to Wiki</a></div>
<p>This wiki is designed to provide you with detailed gameplay information about the popular Korean MMORPG Legend of Mir 3.
</p><p>If you are looking to get instructions on downloading and setting up the latest files, please follow the link below.
</p><p><b><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.lomcn.net/forum/threads/zircon-source-files-and-setup-guide.102240/">LOMCN Mir 3 Zircon Downloads and Guides</a></b>
</p><p>This wiki is open to contributions from all members of LOMCN. Should there be information you need that is not yet listed on the wiki, please ask on the forum.
</p><p>Wiki Contributors: <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.lomcn.net/forum/members/jev.29880/">Jev</a>, <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.lomcn.net/forum/members/martyn.72/">Martyn</a>
</p><p>Code Contributors: <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://github.com/Suprcode/mir3-zircon/graphs/contributors">Contributors</a>
</p>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="References">References</span></h3>
<p>Official Mir 3 Website: <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://mir3.mironline.co.kr/">Wemade Mir 3</a>
</p><p>Official Mir 3 Website: <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://mir3.web.sdo.com/web6/index/index.asp">Shanda Mir 3</a>
</p><p>Coming soon...
</p><p><a href="/wiki/index.php/Maze_Routes" title="Maze Routes">Maze Routes</a>
</p>
